    "required_before_comparative_claim": true
  },
  "baseline_policy": "Run public baseline plus every capable nominated specialist under identical input/prompt/budget and pre-frozen provider settings; retain all results. Select the strongest per-workflow dev baseline before candidate tuning, recording exact adapter/config hashes. Missing nominees remain missing; no advantage claim over an unavailable baseline.",
  "denominator_policy": "All assigned cases, explicit failures/refusals/abstentions/timeouts/missing results and all attempt/auxiliary calls remain visible. Repeat attempts use separate immutable receipts; full-job resource totals include all attempts. Undefined telemetry is null.",
  "superiority_policy": "Each declared workflow must meet completion gain and paired 95% interval, non-regression and quality floor against the strongest retained baseline, with complete timestamps/artifact validators where applicable, zero fabricated support, human audit and observable bounded full-job cost. No composite score or author-reported benchmark is evidence.",
  "minimum_sample_policy": "The initial sealed 27-case contract corpus is not a powered superiority cohort. Independent owner seals at least 30 cases per declared workflow (and family) before live tuning/acceptance. Never extend or edit a failing held-out cohort to obtain a pass.",
  "live_policy": "This harness replays files and never spends, uploads, records, installs or publishes. Live run launches require separately recorded exact resource/operation authority in vrm-0e8.2.9. Labels and source originals stay outside system prompts.",
  "judge_limits": "Canonical facts are exact case/whitespace-normalized targets. Matching a labeled quotation verifies support against a frozen source; it is not semantic grading of arbitrary prose or proof that the model inspected original media. Independent source/media human review and artifact-specific validators remain required.",
  "snapshot_policy": "Hash primary media bytes separately from independent source-snapshots.json judge observations. Judge snapshots/labels/construction records never enter candidate prompts. Snapshot hashes and asset binding are required in sealed manifest."
